CORE
main.cpp
--cpp20
^file main\.cpp line \d+: static assertion failed: primary template of kind$
^CONVERSION ERROR$
^EXIT=6$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^Invariant check failed
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
The static_assert fails while kind<int> is instantiated for the
requires-clause; that is not in the immediate context of the constraint
([temp.constr.atomic]/3, [temp.deduct.general]/8), so the program is
ill-formed: g++ and clang++ reject it.  Printing the constraint, which
holds the lambda-expression, in a diagnostic failed an invariant of expr2c.
